{"id": "1554796763347550208", "channel_id": "1391701560496623688", "author_id": "1272466488304996382", "author_name": "tokumei37", "content": "質問すみません。\n銀の鍵の制約で取るべきキャラクターと今後引くガチャ、組むパーティーを教えていただきたいです。\n所持キャラはこんな感じです。", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T10:07:15.109000+00:00", "attachments": [{"id": "1554796761527095336", "filename": "2026092.JPG", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 432373, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1391701560496623688/1554796761527095336/2026092.JPG?backend=b2&ex=6abe30d2&is=6abcdf52&hm=183b926c25b3adf7b0b4b84b2550894d0ecdeb20469010223722a4c421edfe37&"}, {"id": "1554796762751836270", "filename": "2026091.JPG", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 432503, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1391701560496623688/1554796762751836270/2026091.JPG?backend=b2&ex=6abe30d2&is=6abcdf52&hm=f7017112a45d2fe13c89cd328c167867355c5c59156a46758b44499704ff1a52&"}]}
